<title>ITALY: Italian president to visit Egypt this month.</title>
<headline>Italian president to visit Egypt this month.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italian President Oscar Luigi Scalfaro will visit Egypt on November 29 and 30 at the invitation of Egyptian President Hosni Mubarak, Scalfaro's office said in a statement on Thursday.</p>
<p>Italian Prime Minister Romano Prodi visited Cairo last month for talks with Mubarak.</p>
